      "writtenOn": "2013-10-15T23:08:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "(NIT) I personally think constants should be all caps (easy to identity they are a constant in the code that way when used)",
      "revId": "917eb0665fa8e391fb58daf28438cab010d5a606",
