      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems suboptimal.  Are we planning on eventually supporting a bunch of random base64 alphabets?  Going with a boolean here instead of a string makes more sense in the context of 2 possibilities.  It also eliminates the need to raise the ValueError",
      "revId": "917eb0665fa8e391fb58daf28438cab010d5a606",
