      "author": {
        "id": 8116
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-10-25T16:17:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are 8 different alphabets, we\u0027re currently only interested in 2. But if the parameter was a boolean allowing only a selection of 2 of the possible 8 then the API is not extensible. API\u0027s which are not designed to be extensible create problems later because they demand an API change to accommodate future needs. It\u0027s better to permit future needs without changing the API.",
